#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Congratulations!** You have been added as a moderator to [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Welcome to the Tippr Moderator Community!\n"
"\n"
"As a moderator, you play a vital role in building and maintaining our community. Here are some important things to know:\n"
"\n"
"### Your Responsibilities\n"
"\n"
"- Enforce vault rules and site-wide policies\n"
"- Foster a welcoming environment for community members\n"
"- Review reports and take appropriate action\n"
"- Collaborate with fellow moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Important Resources\n"
"\n"
"- [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Learn about best practices and expectations\n"
"- [Content Policy](/help/contentpolicy) - Understand site-wide rules\n"
"- [User Agreement](/help/useragreement) - Know the terms of service\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Connect with other moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Volunteer Status\n"
"\n"
"Please note that moderators are independent volunteers, not employees of Tippr. For more details, please review the [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for helping make Tippr a great place!"
msgstr ""
"**Gratulerer!** Du er lagt til som moderator i [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Velkommen til Tipprs moderatorfellesskap!\n"
"\n"
"Som moderator har du en viktig rolle i å bygge og ta vare på fellesskapet vårt. Her er noen viktige ting å vite:\n"
"\n"
"### Ansvaret ditt\n"
"\n"
"- Håndhev vaultens regler og retningslinjene for hele siden\n"
"- Bidra til et inkluderende miljø for medlemmene\n"
"- Gå gjennom rapporter og gjør det som trengs\n"
"- Samarbeid med de andre moderatorene\n"
"\n"
"### Viktige ressurser\n"
"\n"
"- [Retningslinjer for moderatorer](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Lær god praksis og hva som forventes\n"
"- [Innholdsregler](/help/contentpolicy) - Forstå reglene for hele siden\n"
"- [Brukeravtale](/help/useragreement) - Kjenn vilkårene for tjenesten\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Kom i kontakt med andre moderatorer\n"
"\n"
"### Frivillig\n"
"\n"
"Merk at moderatorer er uavhengige frivillige, ikke ansatte i Tippr. For flere detaljer, se [Retningslinjer for moderatorer](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Takk for at du hjelper til med å gjøre Tippr til et flott sted!"

